*** PRELUDE
*** D2c-infix-fold — infix builtin fold counts k-1 (2+3+4 = 2 rw), prefix gcd stays 1, upTerm count 3, trace two steps
fmod D2CFOLD is
  protecting NAT .
  protecting META-LEVEL .
endfm
reduce in D2CFOLD : 2 + 3 + 4 .
reduce in D2CFOLD : gcd(12, 18, 8) .
reduce in D2CFOLD : upTerm(2 + 3 + 4) .
set trace on .
reduce in D2CFOLD : 2 + 3 + 4 .
set trace off .
